Plotly.js
=========

Component version: 2.35.2
Bundled distribution: https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.35.2.min.js
Source repository: https://github.com/plotly/plotly.js
Documentation: https://plotly.com/javascript/
License source:
https://github.com/plotly/plotly.js/blob/v2.35.2/LICENSE

Fast Figure bundles the minified Plotly.js distribution directly in the
portable HTML file. The bundled distribution retains its own version,
copyright, and license header.

